  "aria": "Animated scenario of a 30-person heating installer, the same customer call played twice. Without Aeolus, people carry every step by phone and email: a callback after lunch, notes mailed in the evening, a quote retyped and approved by email, and the quote reaches the customer the next week, with fourteen hand-offs by people. With Aeolus, a voice agent answers, the planning agent, the technician’s assistant and the apps carry the work, and the quote is accepted the same day. In both runs the same four people make the same four decisions: Nadia moves an appointment, Jens finds the real fault, Sara sets the price and Wim approves the quote."
 },
